    "body": "My Iphone (ios 10) crasht when using the Contact plugin becease of privacy issue. \n\nIt has to request permission to read / write to the contacts.\n\nsee [issue](https://github.com/apache/cordova-plugin-contacts/pull/131) on contact repo for more info.\n\nerrorlog: \n\n``` bash\n2016-08-04 13:17:02.216101 Clockwise[2001:583092] [access] This app has crashed because it attempted to access privacy-sensitive data without a usage description.  The app's Info.plist must contain an NSContactsUsageDescription key with a string value explaining to the user how the app uses this data.\n(lldb) \n```\n",
